 ;; none of it, root's note of an agent's status on each eval, changes no answer it gives (docs/render.md#how-the-work-stands)
 :seon.agent/main-program [:uuid {:description "The newest commit of main whose program changed, as the agent last heard it; its status reads it. See docs/render.md#how-the-work-stands."}]
 :seon.agent/base-commit [:uuid {:description "The agent branch's merge base as it last heard it."}]
